annotations:
  artifacthub.io/changes: |-
    - kind: changed
      description: "Updated the edge image to v4.10.3. The edge sets Date to the current time, so browsers no longer treat a cached object as already stale and revalidate it. Minimum Browser Cache TTL and Minimum Cache TTL only raise a shorter origin TTL and no longer shorten a longer one; the edge no longer sends X-Edge-TTL."
    - kind: changed
      description: "With EDGE_ACCESS_LOG_SCHEMA=legacy the edge logs only final status 200, matching ie-varnish-logger. The chart default ecs schema still logs every proxied response."
